   "body": "/claim cloud/i800-sonnet\n\nPlan:\n- `NotificationLedgerStore.swift`: check what the `Bool` of the private `update(_:_:)` means for `recordNews` and `markCheckedIfDue`, then use `_ =` or `@discardableResult` accordingly.\n- `ForumScopeBar.swift`: give the `select` closure the isolation it runs with (`@MainActor`), without changing behaviour.\n- Run `swift test` in `Packages/HFRKit`; check whether CI surfaces these warnings; open a draft PR, get an Opus review.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
